    "content": "{\n  \"search_id\": \"search_b2b5fee3f1386564320d2be66394a84a\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://cran.r-project.org//web/packages/dreamer/dreamer.pdf\",\n      \"title\": \"dreamer: Dose Response Models for Bayesian Model Averaging\",\n      \"publish_date\": \"2026-05-08\",\n      \"excerpts\": [\n        \". . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 50\\nsummary.dreamer_bma . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 52\\nsummary.dreamer_mcmc . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 53\\nIndex 55\\ndiagnostics Calculate MCMC Diagnostics for Parameters\\nDescription\\nposterior of difference of doses posterior(output, reference_dose = 0)\\npost_medx Posterior Distribution of Minimum X% Effective Dose\\nDescription\\nPosterior Distribution of Minimum X% Effective Dose\\nUsage\\npost_medx( x, ed, probs, time, lower, upper, greater,\\n42 post_medx\\nsmall_bound, return_samples, ... )\\nsingle model pr_medx(output$mod_linear, ed = 80)\\n52 summary.dreamer_bma\\nsummary.dreamer_bma Summarize Bayesian Model Averaging MCMC Output\\nDescription\\nSummarize parameter inference and convergence diagnostics.\\nUsage\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://cran.r-project.org/web//packages/dreamer/refman/dreamer.html\",\n      \"title\": \"Help for package dreamer\",\n      \"publish_date\": null,\n      \"excerpts\": [\n        \"longitudinal data > End(Not run)\\n* Gelman-Rubin diagnostics should be run to detect convergence issues.\\n* Warnings are thrown if the upper bound of the Gelman-Rubin statistic\\n* is greater than 1.1.\\npredictive distribution\\nplot(output, data = data, predictive = 1)\\nfrom a single model\\nplot_trace(output$mod_linear)\\nPosterior Distribution of Minimum X% Effective Dose\\nDescription\\nPosterior Distribution of Minimum X% Effective Dose\\nUsage\\npost_medx(\\nx,\\ned,\\nprobs,\\ntime,\\nlower,\\nupper,\\ngreater,\\nsmall_bound,\\nreturn_samples,